# ============================================================
#  AMRITA LOG TRACKER — SECRETS TEMPLATE (safe to commit)
#  Copy to .env and fill in real values:   cp .env.example .env
#  Names follow the server id in config.js:
#    LT_<ID>_HOST / LT_<ID>_USER / LT_<ID>_PASS
#    (id upper-cased, anything not A-Z/0-9 becomes _ — "live-ae" → LT_LIVE_AE)
#  Single-quote values that contain $ ! & ( # or spaces.
# ============================================================

